bds 0,8 "ADS-B aircraft identification and category"
date 2026-10-14
preamble
    ADS-B aircraft identification and category (typecode 1-4).
    Source: ICAO Doc 9871 (ICAO Annex 10 Vol. III) Mode S BDS register definition tables.

items

    TC "Type Code"
        definition
            ADS-B message type code.
        element 5
            unsigned integer
        remark
            1-4: identification and category.

    CAT "Aircraft Category"
        definition
            Emitter category.
        element 3
            unsigned integer
        remark
            Meaning depends on the type code; wake vortex category
            is derived from (TC, CAT).

    CS "Callsign"
        definition
            Aircraft identification, 8 ICAO 6-bit characters.
        element 48
            string icao
